	(text "CHARGER NOTES (BQ25883 SLUSDL3A)\n- ILIM: IINMAX = KILIM / RILIM (Eq. 3). KILIM 1012 / 1098 / 1185 (min/typ/max).\n  RILIM = 392R -> 2.58 / 2.80 / 3.02 A: worst case stays at the 3.0 A USB-C cap. Firmware sets IINDPM per CC1/CC2_SENSE.\n- TS: DS 8.3.7.4.1 Eq. 1-2 for 103AT, 0-60 C: RT1 = 5.24k -> 5.23k (REGN-TS), RT2 = 30.31k -> 30.1k (TS-GND).\n- VBUS 1u (C201) + PMID 10u (C202): 11 uF nominal, < 10 uF after DC bias at 5 V (USB-C cSnkBulk).\n- SYS 4 x 22u 25V 1206: ~11-12 uF each at 8.6 V -> >= 44 uF effective. BAT 2 x 22u (>= 10 uF effective).\n- L201 1 uH: Isat 7.4 A >= IIN + ripple/2 = 3.0 + 1.35/2 = 3.7 A (Eq. 5-6, 1.5 MHz). BTST 47n, REGN 4.7u.\n- /CE low (charging on, firmware gates it over I2C). OTG stays disabled: sink-only board.\n- I2C pull-ups live on the MCU sheet. /INT pull-up R208 here."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 144.78 177.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1eb6da6c-db09-5bcf-80a0-2615445c129c")
	)
	(text "CHARGER"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 146.05 120.65 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "Anton")
				(size 5.08 5.08)
				(thickness 0.254)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3169a610-76de-5227-a944-f434e0ed48b4")
	)
	(text "Amber, lights only with USB present (REGN on).\n(5.0 - 1.9) V / 1k5 = ~2 mA. STAT sinks <= 6 mA, abs max 6 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 147.32 147.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "95ab9595-730a-59e8-ab83-c9d84e4aacb9")
	)
	(text "RT201 and J203 are alternatives — populate one.\nJ203: external 10k NTC taped to the pack."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 210.82 116.84 0)
		(effects
